# covers: 1 E3.2, 1a 3.7
# Requires a fresh two-client stack: AUTH_DEV_TOKENS=1 ZONE_SIM_FIXTURE=phase1a-social-aggro.
# Zone/replay id remains 1. Run with 1-social-aggro-b; no other clients in this zone.
# The fixture has exactly three passive, stationary, high-HP NPCs with minimal damage. A alone attacks
# caller at (100,100). Helpers (104,100)/(104,104) receive hate for A only through clan_call.
# B is closer to the helpers than A; it never attacks. All three must swing at A.
# Position rendezvous keeps B observing before the first swing and A connected until B passes.
nf.Login
nf.WaitFor connected 15
nf.EnterWorld
nf.WaitFor in_world 15
nf.WaitFor players_in_view == 1 30
nf.ClickMove 40 40
nf.WaitFor own_at 40 40 0.25 35
nf.ClickMove 80 85
nf.WaitFor own_at 80 85 0.25 36
nf.ClickMove 99 100
nf.WaitFor own_at 99 100 0.25 15
nf.WaitFor proxy_at 104 102 0.25 30
nf.Expect players_in_view == 1
nf.Expect attacked_by == 0
nf.Target nearest_attackable
nf.WaitFor target == SocialAggroFixture 3
nf.Expect target_hp == 1000000
nf.Attack
nf.WaitFor attack_state == active 3
nf.WaitFor attacked_by == 3 15
nf.StopAttack
nf.WaitFor attack_state == idle 3
nf.WaitFor proxy_at 104 103 0.25 15 # B signals its independent observation passed
nf.Within 150
